        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Edwin\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/73ab20/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Edwin:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Ronway wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Why not Expat?\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nWhy not any other hero who (as of the time of this original plan) didn't have multiple versions?\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Shotgun Expatriette, Rifle Expatriette, Machine Gun Expatriette, Dual Pistol Expatriette, and Ammo Supplying Expatriette. Sounded funny enough to&nbsp;want to try it out.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
